              <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-accent-400"></div><span class="text-slate-600">25–29.9 — Overweight</span></div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-red-400"></div><span class="text-slate-600">≥ 30 — Obese</span></div>
